    },
    {
      "id": "e2e-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 70,
      "y": 1690,
      "width": 1330,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "COMPLETE REQUEST LIFECYCLE:\n\n① Founder sends message via React frontend (Next.js / Vite)\n② FastAPI receives request → JWT auth verified (security.py)\n③ PII Middleware intercepts → Presidio scans & strips PII (pii_stripper.py) → Cleaned text continues\n④ Event published to Redis Stream (redis_client.py) → Event Processor consumes async\n⑤ State Tracker loads user's cognitive profile + conversation history (state_tracking.py)\n⑥ RAG Pipeline: Query embedded → pgvector similarity search → top-k relevant docs retrieved (rag_pipeline.py)\n⑦ State-Aware Prompter assembles context: system prompt + RAG docs + cognitive state + bias alerts (state_aware_prompter.py)\n⑧ Inference Router selects model: OpenAI / Ollama / Personalized-LoRA based on task (inference_router.py → personalized_router.py)\n⑨ LLM generates response → Pattern Engine scans for cognitive biases (pattern_recognition.py)\n⑩ Response returned to user → Decision logged → Judgment Tracker scores quality → Scores feed future LoRA training\n\n                    Data at rest: PostgreSQL + pgvector (encrypted)  |  Data in transit: TLS  |  PII: never leaves the perimeter",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "groupIds": ["e2e"],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 602,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 602,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "COMPLETE REQUEST LIFECYCLE:\n\n① Founder sends message via React frontend (Next.js / Vite)\n② FastAPI receives request → JWT auth verified (security.py)\n③ PII Middleware intercepts → Presidio scans & strips PII (pii_stripper.py) → Cleaned text continues\n④ Event published to Redis Stream (redis_client.py) → Event Processor consumes async\n⑤ State Tracker loads user's cognitive profile + conversation history (state_tracking.py)\n⑥ RAG Pipeline: Query embedded → pgvector similarity search → top-k relevant docs retrieved (rag_pipeline.py)\n⑦ State-Aware Prompter assembles context: system prompt + RAG docs + cognitive state + bias alerts (state_aware_prompter.py)\n⑧ Inference Router selects model: OpenAI / Ollama / Personalized-LoRA based on task (inference_router.py → personalized_router.py)\n⑨ LLM generates response → Pattern Engine scans for cognitive biases (pattern_recognition.py)\n⑩ Response returned to user → Decision logged → Judgment Tracker scores quality → Scores feed future LoRA training\n\n                    Data at rest: PostgreSQL + pgvector (encrypted)  |  Data in transit: TLS  |  PII: never leaves the perimeter",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },



