    {
      "id": "compare-hybrid-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 945,
      "y": 1990,
      "width": 370,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "HYBRID (Seedlings Approach)\n\n✓ RAG provides factual grounding\n✓ LoRA provides personalized tone\n✓ Combined: accurate + personal\n✓ Feedback loop improves both over time\n✓ Graceful degradation if either fails\n\nFlow: RAG retrieves context → LoRA-adapted\nmodel generates personalized response →\nPattern engine validates for bias →\nJudgment tracker scores → Scores feed\nback into next LoRA training cycle",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
